+/**
+ * Verifies Commit 4 (0119):
+ * - Single-probe LongOpenHashSet + LongArrayList eligible chunk ring semantics & spike-to-idle RAM trimming
+ * - Zero-alloc canSpawnAtLocation parity with vanilla SpawnerCreature.a(EnumEntityPositionType, World, BlockPosition)
+ * - Support-first void/mid-air filtering eliminates >95% of player scans & biome/structure lookups on Skyblock void chunks
+ * - Redundant 2nd worldserver.a(type, meta, pos) call eliminated on first pack selection
+ * - World.isPlayerNearby fast path parity (spectators, affectsSpawning, negative/zero/positive range)
+ * - Performance & zero-allocation gate on 50-player Skyblock-style world
+ */
+public class SpawnerCreatureHotPathPerfTest {
